I've managed to replicate this.  And it doesn't happen with onedrive, only onedrive for business.

@olihey Do you have any ideas?  I'm thinking this might actually be a bug in onedrive for business, but maybe you can see something rclone is doing that I can't!.

Here is the [resumable file upload API](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/onedrive/developer/rest-api/api/driveitem_createuploadsession) that rclone is using.
